  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-11-25T07:17:09.267Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It would be nice to have the Force Locomotion Animations for 6 Point Tracking toggle built into the new FBT quickmenu. \n\nDue to the toggle being enabled by default when adding the VRC Descriptor to your avatar, most avatar creators never change the option nor figure out what it does. These avatars usually never have a reason to require the option to be enabled in the first place. \nIt makes using FBT with public SDK3 avatars a bit of a hassle if you prefer your tracking not being overridden while walking. It also means avatar creators have to implement logic to disable locomotion animations manually if they want to cater to both sides.\n\nAdding the toggle in-game now that there is a relevant menu would solve these issues.\nnakos",
